{"id":"651236","name":"拌大拉皮","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/651236/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大拉皮","amount":"IO张"},{"name":"豆腐皮","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大拉皮用温水泡发。","img":"images/651236/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"上锅里蒸5分钟凉凉。","img":"images/651236/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"案板上划抹点油。","img":"images/651236/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将蒸好的大拉皮放在案板上。","img":"images/651236/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"凉好后切成条装盘备用。","img":"images/651236/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"豆腐皮切成长条备用。","img":"images/651236/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里加水开了后下豆腐皮煮一下。","img":"images/651236/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香菜洗净切成小段备用。","img":"images/651236/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"波莱洗净放在豆皮里搅匀。","img":"images/651236/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将上述材料放在盘子里备用。","img":"images/651236/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将蒜成沫备用。","img":"images/651236/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蒜沫放在大拉皮上在倒点红油拌匀。","img":"images/651236/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取一个空豌放香菜、水，盐，酱油。","img":"images/651236/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入大拉皮菜里面拌匀即可。","img":"images/651236/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/651236/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}